k  to this one habit and you're much more  likely to follow through and stick to  all the other ones that you have set up  for your life so I want you to come back  every day leave hashtag BTA followed by  the number now a couple rules okay it's  consecutive days so if you leave 5  comments in one day they're all hash tag  BT the same number  if you do a lot over a series of say a  week you build up to the hashtag BT a  seven and then you miss it then you come  back the next day back down to one the  other thing I really want to encourage  you guys to do is support each other  because a big part about sticking the  habits and maintaining goals is having a  feeling like you're not doing this alone  and there's some external motivation  there's a group holding you accountable  so if you see somebody in the comments  and they post  hashtag BTA one congratulate them say  hey congrats on starting this new habit  if you see somebody reach a big number  there at hashtag BT a thirty or  something even bigger saying hey Wow way  to go congratulations just make them  feel special because I believe that we  have a nice community here you look at  the comments you look everybody leaving  all this great feedback on the channel  and I think we can all use that energy  and vibe to help us stick to our other  habits in our business in life and all  build bigger businesses so let the  hashtag be ta Revolution begin leave  your comments below and hopefully I'll  see you again tomorrow
 

